{"sections":[{"slug":"俯范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"俯范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">俯范畴</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"俯范畴"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">俯范畴是表达</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/相对","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">相对观念</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的一种方式</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p>…</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">俯范畴是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/逗号范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">逗号范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的一种</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">极限</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">余极限</span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">俯范畴</span> $\\mathcal C_{/X}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/极限","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">极限</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">等同于</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的原图表加上各对象到</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的态射后所得图表的极限</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">例如</span> $\\mathcal C_{/X}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中</span> $Y\\to X, Z\\to X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/积(范畴论)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">积</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中</span> $Y \\to X \\leftarrow Z$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拉回","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拉回</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">俯范畴中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/余极限","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">余极限</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">等同于原范畴中的余极限</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}}]}